POST /predict/carbon_activation
For the activated carbon: 
    We will accept the input features like the following: 
    {
  "flowrate": 140,
  "influent_toc": 5.2,
  "effluent_toc": 1.1,
  "bed_age": 130,
  "biological_activity": 0.42,
  "clogging_index": 78
}
And it will return: 
{
  "needs_regeneration": true
}

